= Opening of the Whampoa Military Academy

As outlined in our first party congress, the *Whampoa Military Academy* in Canton has been fully established. In an opening ceremony done by Sun Yat-sen, he called for national unity and to join the Guomindang against the warlords.
Here, loyal and skilled officers will be trained by Party and Soviet officials. This will introduce an ideological fervor to the *National Revolutionary Army*, giving reasons for officers to fight and to prevent the non-stop betrayals of Chinese warlords.
As said before, the office of Superintendent of the Academy has to be decided on personally by Sun Yat-sen.

- @chiang: Chiang Kai-shek?

@chiang
on-arrival: whampoa_built = 1; n_advisors = 4; xuchongzhi_advisor = 1; whampoa_strength += 10;
face-image: img/portraits/ChiangKai-shek.jpg

Jiang Jieshi, or Chiang Kai-shek is a young officer from Zhejiang. He was part of the *Tongmenghui* and then rejoined Sun Yat-sen during the *Constitutional Protection Movement*. He recently came back from Moscow, studying Russian military tactics.

He was with Sun Yat-sen during Chen Jiongming's revolt on the *SS Yongfeng* and became sort of a protege to Sun, which he seems have not forgotten and recognized his military talents.

Chiang now controls the Whampoa Military Academy, influencing many young officers in the party and strengthening his influence. Although, he has guaranteed that the Academy will operate smoothly.
